{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：12:16 2026-07-22 HKT<br/>發佈時間：12:16 2026-07-22 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：12:16 2026-07-22 HKT</p><p>紅磡北拱街8號A一幢住宅大廈，今（22 日）早上11時03分，十樓頂層一單位起火冒煙，消防接報到場，出動一喉一煙帽隊，至11時18分將火救熄。起火單位一男一女住客因吸入濃煙不適送院治理。消防經初步調查，疑屋內充電器首先著火冒煙，並無可疑。</p><img alt=\"消防射水救火。蔡楚輝攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3927bee0fe489ef48cf31b72cdc7d7c1/2026-07/WhatsApp_Image_2026-07-22_at_11_56_34.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1282daa36e54180c007e08ad96e82cac/2026-07/WhatsApp_Image_2026-07-22_at_11_56_33.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9d91c17bad1ae457dea9d350940a67db/2026-07/WhatsApp_Image_2026-07-22_at_11_56_32_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"警員到場調查。蔡楚輝攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/fdb6f3a54fa2dd1aa2e18276bbee7c9d/2026-07/WhatsApp_Image_2026-07-22_at_11_56_32.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"消防到場救火。蔡楚輝攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e7ea5fb712112ec5319d93f00b64966d/2026-07/WhatsApp_Image_2026-07-22_at_11_56_31_2_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e2c35c62da96d63d446b1d544c475738/2026-07/WhatsApp_Image_2026-07-22_at_11_56_31_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"頂層起火單位外牆熏黑。蔡楚輝攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0676411bce318341053b0550511e557a/2026-07/WhatsApp_Image_2026-07-22_at_11_56_30.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/fda6b8c7c1066726fd107aa6a37b6d63/2026-07/WhatsApp_Image_2026-07-22_at_11_56_29.jpeg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-22T04:31:27.892380+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":202,"images":8,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}